There are many really, really
great talks that are coming out

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:35.940
and that are really
interesting to watch.

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:39.160
Many go in a little bit more
detail or a lot more detail

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:42.300
in how to migrate your
workloads onto Google Cloud.

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:44.550
I also want to
especially recommend

00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:46.560
you to watch the
