00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:49.080
New with Database Management."

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:51.930
And also check out
our showcase demos

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:56.935
that are available at
cloud.google.com, Next SF Demos

00:23:56.935 --> 00:24:00.290
under Data Management Databases.

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:00.790
All right.

